  "notes": [
    "All amplitudes use all paired wet u/v cells in a fixed region, never reference-speed-selected cells.",
    "Vector power is u\u00b2+v\u00b2, twice kinetic energy per unit mass; ensemble-mean velocity is averaged before speed.",
